<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Demand light on a moderatemovement. Top $58.00 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  56.00-58.00, few 57.50-58.00  56.50-58.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  50.50-56.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs.  46.00-50.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 400 lbs. 0.50 lower, over 400 lbs. steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs.  41.50-42.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs.  42.00-44.00, few 450-500 lbs. 45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs.  44.00-46.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs.  46.50-48.00</p>
